{"id":"u-974c8bc7-53ba-46aa-b904-e36902c1dc5f","src":"community","title":"Healthy Strength","author":"David L.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/yRPvet-weights-for-loose-ligaments","desc":"Progression\nWeek 1: Focus on form and control\nWeek 2: Add volume in either reps or weight\nWeek 3: Challenge yourself in volume\nWeek 4: Deload and recover\nCycle Repeats\n\nAt the start of each new cycle, aim to perform slightly more total work than in the previous one. First, focus on adding 1–2 extra reps within the prescribed rep range before increasing the load. When you’re ready to add weight, progress gradually: 2.5–5 lbs for upper body lifts and 5–10 lbs for lower body lifts. If you aren’t yet ready for more weight, stay at your current load but work toward the higher end of the rep range to maintain progression.\n\nRemember to go slow and perfect your form!\n\nThis program is ideally meant to be used with a 2-day-per-week mobility/core circuit to be performed during a rest day. It will focus more on the support muscles necessary for joint health. It can be found here: https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Jmplr6-add-on-circut","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Women's","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:59:53.569Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Body + Core Stability","Lower Strength + Balance","Mixed Strength + Stability"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Rowing Machine","sets":[{"sec":600,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Band)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pallof Press","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":600}]},{"n":"Box Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":6,"pct":70,"x":5}]},{"n":"Romanian De